<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Composition with Red, Blue and Yellow — Piet Mondrian, 1930</title>
<meta name="description" content="Piet Mondrian's Composition with Red, Blue and Yellow (1930): the painter, the year, De Stijl and why the work matters.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
